  triage:title "check_test_identity_literals.py has no defense against concat!() fragment reassembly" ;
  triage:description "ruthless-boundary-qa reported (AN12-QA-1, quality-mgr, PR #875): .just/check_test_identity_literals.py lacks defense against concat!()-style fragment reassembly. Lint script only examines string literals within individual lines and cannot detect identity literals split across multiple lines via concat!()." ;
